          "en": "Spacer must total 9 mm",
          "zh": "轴套总高应为 9 mm"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The spacer is 9 mm tall. If you cannot buy that height, stack shorter spacers to a total of 9 mm.",
          "zh": "轴套高 9 mm。如果买不到这个高度，就用几个较短的轴套叠到 9 mm。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
